# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored and must never be committed -
# it was tracked in git until Round 8 despite the ignore entry, which is
# exactly how a service-role key would eventually have landed in history.
# The three values below are publishable-tier (safe for the client bundle),
# but the file stays untracked so that property never has to be re-audited.
VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=""
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=""
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=""
